{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>The flocks and cattle.</b> Which they said: who will feed us meat?" "<b>And if all the fish of the sea.</b> Which they said: we remember the fish." "<b>He slaughter for them, he gather for them.</b> By means of a few men, about seventy persons." "<b>And find for them.</b> For six hundred thousand men on foot, apart from children, for a month of days."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:27.840422840Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}